{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are a space traveler who meets space pirates on your journey. At this moment, you engage in a game of life, winning to obtain pirate treasure and losing to pay the price</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Click on 'PALY' to start, press a bullet into the magazine, rotate the magazine, and place the gun on the table.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >PALY button changes to FIRE</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After clicking FIRE, the button will be grayed out; You shoot first. If it's live ammunition, your game will fail and this game will end; If it's an empty shell, the pirates will continue to shoot</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If the pirate fires with live ammunition, the game ends and you win, settling the reward</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If the pirate fires an empty shell, the game continues and the FIRE button lights up, allowing you to continue clicking</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At the same time, the Cashout button lights up, displaying the amount that can be redeemed at this time</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Continue clicking the Fire button until live ammunition is fired, ending this round of the game</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3891850?t=1754897998","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3891850?t=1754897998","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3891850/7abfbceefe658d062f4c5a35a43d5b364b05eba6/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1754897998","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3891850/7abfbceefe658d062f4c5a35a43d5b364b05eba6/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1754897998","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are a space traveler who meets space pirates on your journey. At this moment, you engage in a game of life, winning to obtain pirate treasure and losing to pay the price</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Click on 'PALY' to start, press a bullet into the magazine, rotate the magazine, and place the gun on the table.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >PALY button changes to FIRE</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After clicking FIRE, the button will be grayed out; You shoot first. If it's live ammunition, your game will fail and this game will end; If it's an empty shell, the pirates will continue to shoot</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If the pirate fires with live ammunition, the game ends and you win, settling the reward</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If the pirate fires an empty shell, the game continues and the FIRE button lights up, allowing you to continue clicking</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At the same time, the Cashout button lights up, displaying the amount that can be redeemed at this time</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Continue clicking the Fire button until live ammunition is fired, ending this round of the game</p>","developers":["chunchun"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Free To Play","id":"37"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3891850/2cb7c913d57df14f14a9df77d85af872cf60b0a0/header.jpg?t=1754897998","is_free":true,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3891850/1369541241/147c4a5ac813757c03a7f4ae6c1da127ce87f74b/1753251841/dash_av1.mpd?t=1753763068","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3891850/1369541241/147c4a5ac813757c03a7f4ae6c1da127ce87f74b/1753251841/dash_h264.mpd?t=1753763068","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3891850/1369541241/147c4a5ac813757c03a7f4ae6c1da127ce87f74b/1753251841/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1753763068","id":257170799,"mp4":{"480":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257170799/movie480.mp4?t=1753763068","max":"htt